   "accessed": "2026-11-10",
   "note": "Inch. Morse: large end, small end, length, taper per foot, taper per inch, angle from centre. Morse 4 1/2 printed with large end 1.5000 and taper per foot 0.6240; Wikipedia prints 1.4895 in and 1:19.128 (0.6274 per foot). Jarno No. 2 to 20 and Brown & Sharpe No. 1 to 18 read again on 2026-11-12 (https://littlemachineshop.com/reference/tapers.php)."
  },
  "TNG": {
   "publisher": "Tools-n-Gizmos",
   "title": "Taper specifications (NMTB, CAT/V-flange, ISO 7388-1/DIN 69871, BT)",
