   "accessed": "2026-11-10",
   "note": "Tables credited to Kennametal catalogue 7060 and to ANSI B5.50, ISO 7388-1, DIN 69871, JIS B 6339 and JMTBA AS-403. CAT and BT in inch with mm in brackets (inch used here); CAT 40 flange printed \"2.500 (63.05)\", where 2.500 in is 63.50 mm, so the mm figure is a digit error. The page warns its dimensions are not for part construction or inspection."
  },
  "PARLEC": {
   "publisher": "Parlec",
   "title": "Parlec catalogue p. 6, CAT and BT taper specifications",
